  "title": "Microwave Chi Chi Dango",
  "description": "Microwave chi chi dango is an easy-to-make, sweet, and chewy Japanese dessert made from mochiko (sweet rice flour). Enjoy it as a snack or dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Rella On the radio"
  ],
